            "description": {
              "value": "You enter the stance of a wolf, low to the ground with your hands held like fanged teeth. You can make wolf jaw unarmed attacks. These deal 1d8 piercing damage; are in the brawling group; and have the agile, backstabber, finesse, nonlethal, and unarmed traits.\n\nIf you're flanking a target while in Wolf Stance, your wolf jaw unarmed attacks also gain the trip trait."
